    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sugar Sling Showdown, a vibrant Candyland adventure, players wield their tongues to build, grapple, fling, and duel in a playful candy chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Unique Tongue Mechanics: Grapple, fling, and interact with the environment and enemies using innovative and chaotic tongue-powered gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/3540f54e986ecf2419d67cf7b305ba6b.poster.avif?t=1755085073\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/3540f54e986ecf2419d67cf7b305ba6b.webm?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/3540f54e986ecf2419d67cf7b305ba6b.mp4?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Party game modes: Challenge your friends to different pvp, pve game modes and assert dominance in the candy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/71f3e4d37c272df5488d5a28e3f44937.poster.avif?t=1755085073\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/71f3e4d37c272df5488d5a28e3f44937.webm?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/71f3e4d37c272df5488d5a28e3f44937.mp4?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Co-op mode: Work on Toffee Town together with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/70980d6407fd49852d807b80c7bbb086.poster.avif?t=1755085073\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/70980d6407fd49852d807b80c7bbb086.webm?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/70980d6407fd49852d807b80c7bbb086.mp4?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Nurture and Build: Nurturing rescued babies that'd determine the well being and development of Toffee Town adds a distinct flavor to a simplified colony sim.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/fb53eb3d91a7f06ecb7dffd8d3ee4c2e.poster.avif?t=1755085073\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/fb53eb3d91a7f06ecb7dffd8d3ee4c2e.webm?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/fb53eb3d91a7f06ecb7dffd8d3ee4c2e.mp4?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Sweet fantasy: A distinct flavor of candy and veggie built world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/d3abb923a7eac3a4a2288e246e421ebf.poster.avif?t=1755085073\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/d3abb923a7eac3a4a2288e246e421ebf.webm?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/d3abb923a7eac3a4a2288e246e421ebf.mp4?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In Sugar Sling Showdown, a vibrant Candyland adventure, players wield their tongues to build, grapple, fling, and duel in a playful candy chaos.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >1. Unique Tongue Mechanics: Grapple, fling, and interact with the environment and enemies using innovative and chaotic tongue-powered gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/3540f54e986ecf2419d67cf7b305ba6b.poster.avif?t=1755085073\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/3540f54e986ecf2419d67cf7b305ba6b.webm?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/3540f54e986ecf2419d67cf7b305ba6b.mp4?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >2. Party game modes: Challenge your friends to different pvp, pve game modes and assert dominance in the candy world.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/71f3e4d37c272df5488d5a28e3f44937.poster.avif?t=1755085073\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/71f3e4d37c272df5488d5a28e3f44937.webm?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/71f3e4d37c272df5488d5a28e3f44937.mp4?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >3. Co-op mode: Work on Toffee Town together with your friends.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/70980d6407fd49852d807b80c7bbb086.poster.avif?t=1755085073\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/70980d6407fd49852d807b80c7bbb086.webm?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/70980d6407fd49852d807b80c7bbb086.mp4?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >4. Nurture and Build: Nurturing rescued babies that'd determine the well being and development of Toffee Town adds a distinct flavor to a simplified colony sim.  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/fb53eb3d91a7f06ecb7dffd8d3ee4c2e.poster.avif?t=1755085073\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/fb53eb3d91a7f06ecb7dffd8d3ee4c2e.webm?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/fb53eb3d91a7f06ecb7dffd8d3ee4c2e.mp4?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >5. Sweet fantasy: A distinct flavor of candy and veggie built world</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/d3abb923a7eac3a4a2288e246e421ebf.poster.avif?t=1755085073\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/d3abb923a7eac3a4a2288e246e421ebf.webm?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3687710/extras/d3abb923a7eac3a4a2288e246e421ebf.mp4?t=1755085073\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "short_description": "Sugar Sling Showdown is a candy-slinging 2-6 players party game where you brawl and compete with each other in Crackarena, while protecting and building a sweet society together in ToffeeTown. Your tongue is your ultimate weapon in this chaotic sugary mayhem.",
    "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support",
    "reviews": "\u201cI'm looking forward to Sugar Sling Showdown's full release. This demo has made me emotionally invested and restored some of my faith in humanity. We can still care about others and do good, whether in the real world or a fictional one.\u201d<br>SuperJump Magazine<br>",
